# The functions of Mission_StealMayorShip in level downtown (the script levels/downtown/scripts/mission_stealmayorship.py of Data.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: InitStatus, Init, CreateMissionShip, TestForMissionShip, SetPlatformTarget, TestForCorrectPlatform, UseParkedMayorShip, UsePhoneCab, SetNextMission, CGCalls, StartMission, ContinueMission, SetPoliceListTargetStatus, SetPoliceShipTargetStatus, ComeBack, MissionScorer, OnPoliceDeath, ParkMayorShip.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/downtown/mission_stealmayorship.def replaces this file.
section SetPoliceTargets
setvar OutPolice.OnPoliceCreatedCallback %Mission_StealMayorShip.SetPoliceShipTargetStatus
call Mission_StealMayorShip.SetPoliceListTargetStatus 1
call Mission_StealMayorShip.MissionScorer 0
setvar Menu.MissionScorerCall %Mission_StealMayorShip.MissionScorer
setvar Parking.SwitchCharMissionCallback %Mission_StealMayorShip.ComeBack
